="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◈</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Art</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Music &#38; sound：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">♫</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Music &amp; sound</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Voice：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◉</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Voice</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Writing：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✎</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Writing</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Translation：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">文</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Translation</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Marketing：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Marketing</span> </span> </div> <div class="ai-overview-foot"><span><i class="ai-key used"></i>Reported use</span><span><i class="ai-key"></i>Unmarked does not mean AI-free</span><span class="ai-overview-arrow">View evidence ↗</span></div> </a> <div class="ai-chips"> <span class="chip used">Art</span><span class="chip used">Voice</span>  </div> <div class="actions"> <a class="btn primary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/247970/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam store ↗</a> <button class="btn" id="saveBtn" type="button" title="Saved in this browser only">☆ Save</button> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn" type="button">Share</button> </div> <dl class="facts"> <div><dt>Steam App ID</dt><dd><code>247970</code><button class="copy" id="copyId" type="button">Copy</button></dd></div> <div><dt>Developer</dt><dd>FOR-GAMES CR LTD</dd></div> <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>FOR-GAMES CR LTD</dd></div> <div><dt>Release date</dt><dd>Aug 4, 2026</dd></div> <div><dt>Price</dt><dd>¥ 254.25</dd></div> <div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Windows</dd></div> <div><dt>Genres</dt><dd>Action / Simulation</dd></div> <div><dt>Tags</dt><dd>单人、多人、玩家对战、线上玩家对战、合作、在线合作、Steam 成就、完全支持控制器、已支持 VR、Steam 集换式卡牌、视角舒适度、可调整难度、推荐使用手柄、无需应对快速反应事件、DUALSHOCK 控制器支持、DUALSHOCK 控制器支持、DualSense 控制器支持、DualSense 控制器支持、立体声、环绕声、包含关卡编辑器、可用 HDR、家庭共享</dd></div>   <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd class="clamp">英语, 俄语, 简体中文, 法语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙</dd></div> <div><dt>Website</dt><dd><a href="https://il2-korea.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">il2-korea.com ↗</a></dd></div>  </dl> </aside> </section> <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page"> <a href="#ai">AI use</a> <a href="#evidence">Evidence</a> <a href="#steam">Steam data</a> <a href="#developer">Developer</a> <a href="#sources">Sources &amp; corrections</a> </nav> <section class="section" id="ai"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">AI USE</div><h2>Eight areas, separate answers</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">2 / 8 areas with reported AI use</div> </div> <div class="status-note tone-amber"> <strong>Official AI disclosure</strong><span>The developer has disclosed generative AI use. The original source defines its scope.</span> </div> <p class="section-lede">The Korean War entry of the IL-2 series, released on Aug 4, 2026. The developer lists three uses of generative technology: in-game radio communication produced with text-to-speech built on recordings by the team and voice actors, and pilot portraits and Career mode images made through AI-assisted workflows over the studio&#39;s own assets, then manually reviewed and refined, adding that generative AI does not replace creative direction and that the team curates and finalises all of it.</p>  <div class="table-wrap"> <table class="ai-table"> <thead> <tr><th>Area</th><th>Scope</th><th>Status</th><th>Notes</th></tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>In-game generation</strong><small>In-game AI</small></td> <td class="muted">Content generated during play</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Code</strong><small>Code</small></td> <td class="muted">Programming and development</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Art</strong><small>Art</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Visual assets</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">Pilot portraits and Career mode images come from AI-assisted workflows built on the studio&#39;s own assets, screenshots, models and historical references, which the developer states were then manually reviewed and refined by their artists.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Music &amp; sound</strong><small>Music &amp; SFX</small></td> <td class="muted">Music and sound</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Voice</strong><small>Voice</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Voice and dialogue audio</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">In-game radio speech is produced with text-to-speech technology built on recordings made by the team and by voice actors under agreements; the disclosure does not say whether the lines are pre-rendered or synthesised at run time.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Writing</strong><small>Writing</small></td> <td class="muted">Story and written content</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Translation</strong><small>Translation</small></td> <td class="muted">Translation and localization</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Marketing</strong><small>Marketing</small></td> <td class="muted">Promotional material</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="legend"> <span><i class="dot used"></i>Reported use (official / third-party)</span> <span><i class="dot not_stated"></i>Not stated (not proof of no use)</span> <span><i class="dot claimed_none"></i>Developer claims no AI</span> <span><i class="dot unreviewed"></i>Unreviewed</span> </div> <blockquote class="quote"> <p>“Generative technologies are used in Korea. IL-2 Series as production tools for selected types of content: in-game radio communications, pilot portraits and images used in Career mode. Radio communications use text-to-speech technology based on voice recordings made by our team and voice actors under the relevant agreements. Pilot portraits and Career mode images are created with AI-assisted workflows based on our own assets, in-game screenshots, models, and historical references, then manually reviewed and refined by our artists. Generative AI is not used as a replacement for creative direction. All such content is curated, checked, and finalized by the development team.”</p> <footer>Steam 商店 AI 生成内容披露栏完整原文，2026-11-03 核查；可能随商店页更新。 · <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/247970/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original ↗</a></footer> </blockquote> <details class="callout"> <summary><strong>How to interpret these statuses</strong></summary> <p>Reported AI use: 2/8. Developer no-use claims: 0/8. Claims are not independent verification; not stated does not mean no AI use.</p> </details> <p class="source-line"> Primary source:<a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/247970/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official disclosure ↗</a> <span> · Reviewed 2026-11-03</span> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="evidence"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE</div><h2>Evidence</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">4 sources</div> </div> <div class="timeline"> <article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Official disclosure</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</h3> <p>Generative technologies are used in Korea. IL-2 Series as production tools for selected types of content: in-game radio communications, pilot portraits and images used in Career mode. Radio communications use text-to-speech technology based on voice recordings made by our team and voice actors under the relevant agreements. Pilot portraits and Career mode images are created with AI-assisted workflows based on our own assets, in-game screenshots, models, and historical references, then manually reviewed and refined by our artists. Generative AI is not used as a replacement for creative direction. All such content is curated, checked, and finalized by the development team.</p> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/247970/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Steam discussion index</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>Steam 讨论区首页核查</h3> <p>英文讨论区首页显示 15 个主题（总数 274）；仅覆盖首页。</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/247970/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Community report</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>AI pilot call outs</h3> <p>A strange change from GB is the frequency of the AI wingman&#39;s callouts to you in mission. Sure, &#39;Bauke Bauke&#39; is burnt into my brain, and supposedly the new voice system should keep callouts more helpful. But its the volume of callouts thats gone down, and the game is worse for it. I was flying my MiG-15 career, and got into a furball with Sabers. At no time did the AI give me a &#39;bandits, four low&#39; or even a &#39;Tally!&#39; or whatever the North Korean/Russian equivalent is. Maybe I forgot to explicitly order them to tally bandits, but why do I need to tell the AI to do this at all, wouldn&#39;t standing doctrine be to do this? Something established in training? But its not just in air callouts either, the AI seems very hit or miss with whenever any voice communication occurs. I give commands and they just... say nothing. Not even a confirmation? Something seems almost bugged in the behavior. Its a small thing, but very frustrating. LukeFF View Profile View Posts [developer] Nov 1 @ 1:49pm Report this post You can order them to or to not call out enemy contacts from the command menu. #1 PopaStern View Profile View Posts Nov 1 @ 1:53pm Report this post The Ai behavior is set on automatic by default and act on everything without requiring your flight lead input. This also means that they often won&#39;t respond to your commands. If you would rather they obey to your commands, mostly, go to settings/game/artificial intelligence and select the option &quot;Maintain Formation&quot;. I noticed more radio replies when this is turned on, such as flight formation confirmations. I also would like having more control on radio volume in the future. My biggest negative on this topic is the often uncomprehensible ai voices forcing me to open my map screen to read the chat bubbles. I read that a voice rework is in the works so we can expect things to get better. Fly safe! #2 BeondTheGrave View Profile View Posts 15 hours ago Report this post Originally posted by LukeFF : You can order them to or to not call out enemy contacts from the command menu. Which is inconsistent, half the time they *still* don&#39;t do it, and anyway should be the default behavior and *not* something I have to check each sortie. In general, as I note above, the AI seems to only ever half reply to your commands which means you really don&#39;t know if the command has taken, if the behavior has changed, etc. until after its too late. Poor response to player input. The Ai behavior is set on automatic by default and act on everything without requiring your flight lead input. This also means that they often won&#39;t respond to your commands. If you would rather they obey to your commands, mostly, go to settings/game/artificial intelligence and select the option &quot;Maintain Formation&quot;. I noticed more radio replies when this is turned on, such as flight formation confirmations. Thanks I will try this and see if it helps. A voice rework would be very appreciated overall. I&#39;ve slowly come to &#39;understand&#39; the AI voice, whenever it does trigger, but its like learning greek it can be very garbled. The Korean voices in my MiG-15 are quite poor, coming from someone whose been trying to learn Korean a few years now. I don&#39;t hate what theyre going for with this new voice system, but where it is now is unnecessarily challenging. #3 LukeFF View Profile View Posts [developer] 11 hours ago Report this post Originally posted by PopaStern : The Ai behavior is set on automatic by default and act on everything without requiring your flight lead input. This also means that they often won&#39;t respond to your commands. If you would rather they obey to your commands, mostly, go to settings/game/artificial intelligence and select the option &quot;Maintain Formation&quot;. I noticed more radio replies when this is turned on, such as flight formation confirmations. I also would like having more control on radio volume in the future. My biggest negative on this topic is the often uncomprehensible ai voices forcing me to open my map screen to read the chat bubbles. I read that a voice rework is in the works so we can expect things to get better. Fly safe! Yes, we are continuing to work on improving the system. BTW, you can control the radio volume just like in GB. The only limitation right now is the radio beacon volume is tied to it as well. #4</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/247970/discussions/0/573805391546193767/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Third-party source</span> <time>2026-11-03</time> </div> <h3>AI Transparency Index 复刻本作商店披露的分析页</h3> <p>AI-assisted workflows were used to create in-game radio communications, pilot portraits, and Career mode images, which were manually reviewed and refined.</p> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/247970" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article> </div> <details class="callout"><summary><strong>Review notes (expand)</strong></summary><p>Reviewed the full English Steam AI disclosure, the identity (developer and publisher FOR-GAMES CR LTD) and the English discussion homepage (15 visible topics of 274), where one topic directly mentions AI; it was opened and read in full. The post is gameplay feedback about how often the wingman radio callouts happen under the new voice system rather than a question about AI content, so it is logged without changing any area finding. This title was searched 1 time with 6 results and 1 raw source was read: an AI Transparency Index page reproducing the store disclosure, a transcription rather than independent verification. The remaining results were a Portuguese-locale thread on this game&#39;s board, two Reddit threads with no readable body, one of which refers to the AI in this game&#39;s preview, the store page and a PCGamingWiki entry. Every area finding comes from the store disclosure text itself and rests on the developer&#39;s own statement, without an independent audit. The disclosure does not say whether the radio speech is pre-rendered or generated live, so in-game generation is recorded as not addressed, and code, music, writing and marketing are not addressed either.</p></details> </section> <section class="section" id="steam"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">STEAM DATA</div><h2>Steam data</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Public data snapshot</div> </div> <div class="stat-grid"> <div class="stat"> <span>Online now</span> <strong>32</strong> <small>Steam public API</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Steam reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>No data</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Positive reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>All languages</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Release date</span> <strong>2026</strong> <small>Aug 4, 2026</small> </div> </div> <div class="steam-desc"><h3>Steam description</h3><p>《IL2捍卫雄鹰：朝鲜战争》是一款以朝鲜战争为背景的次世代飞行模拟游戏。坐进早期喷气式战斗机的驾驶舱，亲手改写那场传奇空战的历史吧。</p></div> <p class="source-line"> Player and review figures are Steam snapshots taken at build time and may be delayed. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/247970/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View current data on Steam ↗</a> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="developer"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER</div><h2>Developer</h2></div></div> <div class="dev-card"> <div class="dev-avatar">FO</div> <div class="dev-body"> <h3>FOR-GAMES CR LTD</h3> <p>Developer / publisher</p> <div class="dev-links"> <a href="https://il2-korea.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Website ↗</a> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/search/?developer=FOR-GAMES%20CR%20LTD" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer on Steam ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Korea.%20IL-2%20Series%EF%BC%88247970%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F247970-korea-il-2-series%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claim / correct ↗</a> </div> </div> </div>  </section> <section class="section" id="community"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</div><h2>Player impressions</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Separate from official disclosures</div> </div> <p class="section-lede">Player impressions are not evidence of AI use. Votes do not change developer disclosure findings.</p> <form id="voteForm" class="vote-form"> <select id="voteSelect" required aria-label="Choose your impression"> <option value="">Your impression…</option> <option value="no_ai_suspected">I suspect no AI use</option> <option value="some_ai_suspected">I suspect some AI use</option> <option value="heavy_ai_suspected">I suspect extensive AI use</option> <option value="all_ai_suspected">I suspect AI throughout</option> </select> <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Submit</button> </form> <p id="voteMessage" class="muted" role="status"></p> <div id="voteCounts" class="vote-counts"></div> <p class="source-line">Feedback availability does not affect the evidence. One vote per network per game.</p> </section> <section class="section" id="sources"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOURCES</div><h2>Sources &amp; review limits</h2></div></div> <ul class="source-list"> <li> <span>Official disclosure</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/247970/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li><li> <span>Steam discussion index</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/247970/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 讨论区首页核查</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li><li> <span>Community report</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/247970/discussions/0/573805391546193767/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI pilot call outs</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li><li> <span>Third-party source</span> <a href="https://aitransparencyindex.com/products/steam/247970" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI Transparency Index 复刻本作商店披露的分析页</a> <time>2026-11-03</time> </li> <li> <span>Steam store</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/247970/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Korea. IL-2 Series · App 247970</a> <time></time> </li> </ul> <div class="callout"> <strong>Found an error?</strong> <p> Please include an original source, date and specific correction. <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Korea.%20IL-2%20Series%EF%BC%88247970%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F247970-korea-il-2-series%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a correction ↗</a> or <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Korea.%20IL-2%20Series%20%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue ↗</a>。
</p> </div> </section> <div class="share-bar"> <span>Share this game</span> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn2" type="button">Copy link</button> <a class="btn" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Does%20Korea.%20IL-2%20Series%20use%20AI%3F&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F247970-korea-il-2-series%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Share on X</a> <a class="btn" href="https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F247970-korea-il-2-series%2F&title=Korea.%20IL-2%20Series%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20use%20evidence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reddit</a> </div> </main> <div class="tf-cta-wrap"><a class="tf-cta" href="https://toolfavor.com/?utm_source=gameaichecker&utm_medium=footer_button" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9.5l-4.6 1.9L12 16l-1.9-4.6L5.5 9.5l4.6-1.9z"></path><path d="M19 15l.8 1.9 1.9.8-1.9.8L19 20.4l-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.8z"></path></svg><span>Discover more useful tools on ToolFavor</span><svg class="tf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="wrap"> <span>Game AI Checker · Independent of Valve / Steam.</span> <span>Evidence first · Not stated does not mean unused</span> </div> </footer> <dialog class="lightbox" id="lightbox"> <button id="closeLightbox" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button> <img id="lightboxImg" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"> <div class="lightbox-caption" id="lightboxCaption"></div> </dialog> <script>
    (() => {
      const app = document.getElementById('app');
      const labels = JSON.parse(app?.dataset.ui || '{}');
      const tx = key => labels[key] || key;
      const en = document.documentElement.lang === 'en';
      const key = app?.dataset.gameKey || '';
      const slug = app?.dataset.slug || '';

      document.querySelectorAll('img[data-fallback]').forEach((img) => {
        const fallback = img.dataset.fallback;
        if (!fallback) return;
        img.addEventListener('error', function onError() {
          img.removeEventListener('error', onError);
          img.dataset.fallback = '';
          img.src = fallback;
          img.addEventListener('error', () => { img.style.display = 'none'; }, { once: true });
        });
      });

      const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');
      const heroMedia = document.getElementById('heroMedia');
      const thumbs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.thumb'));
      const counter = document.getElementById('mediaCount');
      const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pauseBtn');
      let index = 0;
      let paused = false;
      let hovering = false;
      let timer = null;

      const warmedImages = new Set();
      function warm(full) {
        if (!full || warmedImages.has(full)) return null;
        warmedImages.add(full);
        const image = new Image();
        image.decoding = 'async';
        image.src = full;
        return image;
      }
      // Browse one frame ahead so the lightbox never waits on a cold round trip.
      function warmAround() {
        if (!thumbs.length) return;
        const upcoming = [thumbs[index], thumbs[(index + 1) % thumbs.length]];
        const run = () => upcoming.forEach((thumb) => thumb && warm(thumb.dataset.full));
        if (typeof window.requestIdleCallback === 'function') window.requestIdleCallback(run, { timeout: 1500 });
        else setTimeout(run, 500);
      }

      function show(next) {
        if (!heroImg || !thumbs.length) return;
        index = (next + thumbs.length) % thumbs.length;
        const thumb = thumbs[index];
        heroImg.src = thumb.dataset.src || heroImg.src;
        heroImg.dataset.full = thumb.dataset.full || heroImg.dataset.full;
        thumbs.forEach((item, position) => item.classList.toggle('active', position === index));
        if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
        warmAround();
      }

      function schedule() {
        clearInterval(timer);
        if (thumbs.length < 2 || paused || hovering || document.hidden) return;
        timer = setInterval(() => show(index + 1), 6000);
      }

      thumbs.forEach((thumb) => {
        thumb.addEventListener('click', () => {
          show(Number(thumb.dataset.index || 0));
          schedule();
        });
      });

      document.getElementById('prevBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index - 1); schedule(); });
      document.getElementById('nextBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index + 1); schedule(); });
      pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        paused = !paused;
        pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : 'Ⅱ';
        pauseBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', paused ? tx("继续轮播") : tx("暂停轮播"));
        schedule();
      });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { hovering = true; schedule(); });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', schedule);
      schedule();

      const appId = app?.dataset.appid;
      if (appId && heroImg && !heroImg.getAttribute('src')?.startsWith('/images/steam/')) {
        fetch(`/api/steam-media?id=${encodeURIComponent(appId)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            if (!data?.available) return;
            for (const shot of data.screenshots || []) {
              const src = shot.thumbnail || shot.full;
              const full = shot.full || shot.thumbnail;
              if (!src || thumbs.some((thumb) => thumb.dataset.full === full)) continue;
              const thumb = document.createElement('button');
              thumb.className = 'thumb';
              thumb.type = 'button';
              thumb.dataset.src = src;
              thumb.dataset.full = full;
              thumb.dataset.index = String(thumbs.length);
              thumb.setAttribute('aria-label', `第 ${thumbs.length + 1} 张图片`);
              const image = document.createElement('img');
              image.src = src;
              image.alt = '';
              image.loading = 'lazy';
              image.decoding = 'async';
              thumb.append(image);
              thumb.addEventListener('click', () => { show(Number(thumb.dataset.index)); schedule(); });
              document.getElementById('thumbs')?.append(thumb);
              thumbs.push(thumb);
            }
            if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
            const countText = document.getElementById('mediaCountText');
            if (countText) countText.textContent = `${thumbs.length} ${en ? 'official images' : '张官方图片'}`;
            schedule();

            if (data.movies?.length) {
              const mediaCol = document.querySelector('.media-col');
              let videos = document.querySelector('.videos');
              if (!videos && mediaCol) {
                videos = document.createElement('div');
                videos.className = 'videos';
                videos.innerHTML = '<div class="mini-title"></div><div class="video-grid"></div>';
                videos.querySelector('.mini-title').textContent = tx('宣传视频');
                mediaCol.append(videos);
              }
              const grid = videos?.querySelector('.video-grid');
              if (grid) {
                const first = data.movies.find((movie) => movie.webm || movie.mp4);
                if (first) {
                  const player = document.createElement('video');
                  player.className = 'trailer';
                  player.controls = true;
                  player.preload = 'none';
                  player.poster = first.thumbnail || '';
                  player.src = first.webm || first.mp4;
                  grid.before(player);
                }
                for (const movie of data.movies.slice(0, 4)) {
                  if (!movie.thumbnail) continue;
                  const link = document.createElement('a');
                  link.className = 'video-card';
                  link.href = data.steamUrl || `https://store.steampowered.com/app/${appId}/`;
                  link.target = '_blank';
                  link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
                  const poster = document.createElement('img');
                  poster.src = movie.thumbnail;
                  poster.alt = movie.name || tx("宣传视频");
                  poster.loading = 'lazy';
                  const label = document.createElement('span');
                  label.textContent = `${movie.name || tx("观看宣传视频")} ↗`;
                  link.append(poster, label);
                  grid.append(link);
                }
              }
            }
          })
          .catch(() => {});
      }

      const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
      const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
      const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightboxCaption');
      function openLightbox() {
        if (!heroImg || !lightbox || !lightboxImg) return;
        const full = heroImg.dataset.full || heroImg.src;
        // The 1280 hero frame is already decoded, so the dialog shows at once and upgrades in place.
        lightboxImg.src = heroImg.currentSrc || heroImg.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (lightboxCaption) lightboxCaption.textContent = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (typeof lightbox.showModal === 'function') lightbox.showModal();
        const larger = warm(full);
        if (larger) larger.onload = () => { lightboxImg.src = larger.src; };
      }
      document.getElementById('openLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      heroImg?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      [document.getElementById('openLightbox'), heroMedia].forEach((node) => node?.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => warm(heroImg?.dataset.full), { once: true }));
      document.getElementById('closeLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', () => lightbox?.close());
      lightbox?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { if (event.target === lightbox) lightbox.close(); });

      const saveBtn = document.getElementById('saveBtn');
      const starKey = `gac:star:${slug}`;
      function paintStar() {
        if (!saveBtn) return;
        const active = localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1';
        saveBtn.textContent = active ? tx("★ 已收藏") : tx("☆ 收藏");
        saveBtn.classList.toggle('active', active);
      }
      saveBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1') localStorage.removeItem(starKey);
        else localStorage.setItem(starKey, '1');
        paintStar();
      });
      paintStar();

      async function copyLink() {
        const url = window.location.href;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
          flash(tx("链接已复制"));
        } catch {
          window.prompt(tx("复制链接"), url);
        }
      }
      function flash(message) {
        const target = document.getElementById('voteMessage') || document.getElementById('shareBtn');
        if (!target) return;
        const original = target.textContent;
        if (target.id === 'voteMessage') {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = original; }, 2200);
        } else {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = tx("分享"); }, 2200);
        }
      }
      async function share() {
        if (navigator.share) {
          try {
            await navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: window.location.href });
            return;
          } catch {}
        }
        copyLink();
      }
      document.getElementById('shareBtn')?.addEventListener('click', share);
      document.getElementById('shareBtn2')?.addEventListener('click', copyLink);

      document.getElementById('copyId')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const id = app?.dataset.appid;
        if (!id) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(id);
          flash(tx("App ID 已复制"));
        } catch {}
      });

      const voteForm = document.getElementById('voteForm');
      const voteMessage = document.getElementById('voteMessage');
      const voteCounts = document.getElementById('voteCounts');
      const voteSelect = document.getElementById('voteSelect');
      const voteNames = {
        no_ai_suspected: tx("认为没有使用 AI"),
        some_ai_suspected: tx("认为部分使用 AI"),
        heavy_ai_suspected: tx("认为大量使用 AI"),
        all_ai_suspected: tx("认为几乎全程使用 AI"),
      };
      function showCounts(counts) {
        if (!voteCounts) return;
        voteCounts.replaceChildren();
        for (const [code, label] of Object.entries(voteNames)) {
          const value = Number(counts?.[code] || 0);
          if (!value) continue;
          const row = document.createElement('div');
          row.textContent = en ? `${value} players ${label}` : `${value} 位玩家${label}`;
          voteCounts.append(row);
        }
      }
      if (voteForm && key) {
        fetch(`/api/feedback?game=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            showCounts(data.counts);
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈功能已启用。");
          })
          .catch(() => {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("匿名反馈暂未启用，等待管理员配置数据库。");
          });
        voteForm.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          const vote = voteSelect?.value;
          if (!vote) return;
          const button = voteForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
          if (button) button.disabled = true;
          try {
            const response = await fetch('/api/feedback', {
              method: 'POST',
              headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ game: key, vote }),
            });
            const data = await response.json();
            if (!response.ok) {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = response.status === 409 ? tx("该网络已对本游戏投过票。") : tx("提交失败，请稍后再试。");
              if (data.counts) showCounts(data.counts);
            } else {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈已记录，谢谢参与。");
              showCounts(data.counts);
              voteForm.reset();
            }
          } catch {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("网络错误，请稍后重试。");
          } finally {
            if (button) button.disabled = false;
          }
        });
      }

      const navLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a'));
      if (navLinks.length && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        const linksById = new Map(navLinks.map((link) => [link.getAttribute('href')?.slice(1), link]));
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          for (const entry of entries) {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
            navLinks.forEach((link) => link.classList.remove('active'));
            linksById.get(entry.target.id)?.classList.add('active');
          }
        }, { rootMargin: '-35% 0px -55% 0px' });
        document.querySelectorAll('section[id]').forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
      }
    })();
  </script> <script>
    document.getElementById('game-language')?.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
      const slug = document.getElementById('app')?.dataset.slug;
      if (slug) window.location.assign('/games/' + (event.target.value === 'en' ? '' : event.target.value + '/') + encodeURIComponent(slug) + '/' + location.hash);
    });
  </script> </body> </html>